# Settings menu on qed.ui: filter, toggle a bool, number prompt, keybinds tab with chord capture.
file a.txt
x
end
run a.txt
wait x
key ctrl+p
type settings open
key enter
wait auto_close_pairs
type line_wrap
wait Soft wrap
key enter
wait line_wrap set to false
snap toggled
key ctrl+a
type tab_width
wait Display width
key enter
wait tab_width: 4
snap prompt
key esc
key tab
wait Chord
key ctrl+a
type toggle line wrap
key enter
wait Press a chord
snap chord
key esc esc esc
snap closed
